WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.491
The mice dived into their hole.

2
00:00:07.492 --> 00:00:11.280
"They don't like our music," Tor said.

3
00:00:11.281 --> 00:00:18.729
Sara nodded. "Let's go somewhere else."

4
00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:25.467
Sara, Sid, and Tor walked around.

5
00:00:25.468 --> 00:00:29.066
Sara shook her seed pods.

6
00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:32.073
Tor played her flute.

7
00:00:32.074 --> 00:00:39.454
And Sid slapped his tail.

8
00:00:39.455 --> 00:00:42.010
Sid slapped a big log.

9
00:00:42.011 --> 00:00:45.265
Ba-doom! Ba-doom!

10
00:00:45.266 --> 00:00:50.112
The log made a hollow sound.

11
00:00:50.113 --> 00:00:53.814
"Cool sound!" Sara said.

12
00:00:53.815 --> 00:01:02.158
Rattle, rattle, tweet, ba-doom!

13
00:01:02.159 --> 00:01:05.929
Lizards jumped out of the log.

14
00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:08.668
They ran away.

15
00:01:08.669 --> 00:01:12.768
Sid felt bad about scaring them.

16
00:01:12.769 --> 00:01:16.017
"Sorry!" he yelled.

17
00:01:16.018 --> 00:01:23.096
But the lizards were gone.

18
00:01:23.097 --> 00:01:26.172
The buddies walked some more.

19
00:01:26.173 --> 00:01:29.851
Soon they found Rex.

20
00:01:29.852 --> 00:01:34.042
Rex was still making his tower.

21
00:01:34.043 --> 00:01:37.426
"Hi, Rex," Sid said.

22
00:01:37.427 --> 00:01:48.873
"We're making music."

23
00:01:48.874 --> 00:01:54.619
Sid swung his tail at things.

24
00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:58.976
He made different sounds.

25
00:01:58.977 --> 00:02:04.558
Sid hit rocks, trees, and bushes.

26
00:02:04.559 --> 00:02:11.600
And then . . . Wham!

27
00:02:11.601 --> 00:02:14.142
He hit Rex's tower.

28
00:02:14.143 --> 00:02:17.546
Crash!

